      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1793843897,
      "updated": 1793843898
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe2ba00000000009adb88",
      "text": "\t久々に見たら Gyazo の紐づけ切れてる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1793843898,
      "updated": 1793843919
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe2c700000000009adb89",
      "text": "\tなんか手続きがややこしくなってる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1793843911,
      "updated": 1793844044
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe2ba00000000009adb87",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1793843898,
      "updated": 1793843898
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe45d0000000000b6062b",
      "text": "[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793844318,
      "updated": 1793844318
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe45e0000000000b6062d",
      "text": "\t米国選挙で、また時代が変わる音がする",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793844318,
      "updated": 1793844334
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec271e0000000000878228",
      "text": "\t[/tomoni]を、museに観察させて、[/muse-observes-tomoni]で公開日記を書かせることにしてみた。",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793861407,
      "updated": 1793861428
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec2a1b00000000004fd366",
      "text": "\t\tおもしろい試み[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793862172,
      "updated": 1793862177
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec2a2400000000004fd367",
      "text": "\t\t\t確かにこういう内言みたいなのは[/tomoni]に直に書くのはためらわれる気持ちがある",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793862180,
      "updated": 1793862576
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec464b0000000000cc9390",
      "text": "\t今週、museでだいぶ遊んだが、重いことさせてないとはいえ、けっこう持つもんだな",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793869387,
      "updated": 1793869433
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec46790000000000cc9391",
      "text": "\t\t[https://gyazo.com/5f5d4fadea8b5caf34cb071ae525f02c]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793869434,
      "updated": 1793869437
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8da00000000003f0c86",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845461,
      "updated": 1793845461
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8da00000000003f0c87",
      "text": "[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845461,
      "updated": 1793845462
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8db00000000003f0c88",
      "text": " 昨日久々に早く寝たけど、寝付けなかった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845462,
      "updated": 1793845472
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8e500000000003f0c89",
      "text": " 　2時間くらいしか寝なかった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845472,
      "updated": 1793845476
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8e900000000003f0c8a",
      "text": " 昼になって眠気が出てきて、あまり頭が動かなくなってきた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845476,
      "updated": 1793845495
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe8f900000000003f0c8b",
      "text": " 　早く帰って寝たい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1793845495,
      "updated": 1793845502
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebea930000000000db3341",
      "text": " 　[お茶.icon][Hiro Aki.icon][sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793845907,
      "updated": 1793846708
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebe45e0000000000b6062c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793844318,
      "updated": 1793846800
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebf65800000000009cb29f",
      "text": "[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793848921,
      "updated": 1793848922
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebf65900000000009cb2a0",
      "text": " 放浪の旅に出たうちの家がかなりタフなルートで進んでる",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793848922,
      "updated": 1793848941
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebf66c00000000009cb2a1",
      "text": " \t[https://gyazo.com/159dcbeb2321f90436390d0223aa17ab]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793848941,
      "updated": 1793848942
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebf66e00000000009cb2a2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793848942,
      "updated": 1793848942
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebfba40000000000427b9d",
      "text": "[koyoshi.icon]",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793850276,
      "updated": 1793850283
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebfbab0000000000427b9e",
      "text": " 最近、井戸端よりもtomoniとか AIの書いた日記を見てる時間のほうが長いかも",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793850284,
      "updated": 1793850396
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0b99000000000056cb6e",
      "text": " うちのAIもtomoniに参加させた！",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793854361,
      "updated": 1793854377
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec36ce0000000000d1ecfb",
      "text": " アソビュー、お前もか！",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793865422,
      "updated": 1793865436
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec36dd0000000000d1ecfc",
      "text": "  [https://www.asoview.co.jp/news/articles/AyTdT_tX 委託先メール配信サービスへの不正アクセスに関するお詫びとお知らせ |NEWS|アソビュー株式会社]",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793865437,
      "updated": 1793865443
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebfbd10000000000427b9f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1793850322,
      "updated": 1793850323
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec08ea00000000007272ce",
      "text": "[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793853674,
      "updated": 1793853675
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec08ec00000000007272cf",
      "text": " サイバー攻撃で冷蔵庫ハックの違和感",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793853676,
      "updated": 1793853692
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec08fc00000000007272d0",
      "text": "  金銭が目的ではなさそうなので、ハックを仕掛けた側の動機がなんだろうか？",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793853692,
      "updated": 1793853858
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec091900000000007272d1",
      "text": "   身代金を要求したけど無視されたから報復とか？",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793853721,
      "updated": 1793853739
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec092c00000000007272d2",
      "text": "  嫌がらせというか鬱憤晴らしぐらいにしか思えない。",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793853740,
      "updated": 1793853838
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0a7400000000007272d3",
      "text": " ネットワークに繋がる機械、必要に応じてネットワークを切っておく仕組みが必要になると思った",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854068,
      "updated": 1793854114
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0aa300000000007272d4",
      "text": "  ルーターの電源を切っておく。メンテのときに電源入れてネットに繋ぐ、とか。",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854115,
      "updated": 1793854152
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0ac800000000007272d5",
      "text": "  ソフトウェア的な切断はいくらでも乗り越えられるから、物理的に切る繋ぐを意識する時代なのかも。",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854152,
      "updated": 1793854183
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0b4600000000007272d6",
      "text": " 今までの便利さを手放していかないと、被害の拡大を止められないように思った",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854279,
      "updated": 1793854319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0be200000000007272d7",
      "text": " というか業務用冷蔵庫がなんでネットワークに繋がる必要があったんだ？という疑問",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854434,
      "updated": 1793854461
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec0bfe00000000007272d8",
      "text": "  故障情報をメーカーに送信して、メーカー側からメンテに来る仕組みとかがあったのかな？",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793854462,
      "updated": 1793854627
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3ddb0000000000963812",
      "text": " chatgptアプリにある、「利用上限リセット」がとても良い",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867227,
      "updated": 1793867367
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3df50000000000963813",
      "text": "  plusブランでの話",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867253,
      "updated": 1793867331
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3e730000000000963817",
      "text": "  2つ使えるようになってる",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867379,
      "updated": 1793867386
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3e440000000000963816",
      "text": "  5h制限とかに引っかかった時に使う",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867331,
      "updated": 1793867331
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3f23000000000096381a",
      "text": "   チケット使うと利用上限がリセットされる",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867555,
      "updated": 1793867580
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3e7d0000000000963818",
      "text": "   使っても、しばらく経つとチケット復活してる、っぽい",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867389,
      "updated": 1793867590
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3e070000000000963814",
      "text": "   追加料金なしでチケット生えてる気がする",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867271,
      "updated": 1793867596
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3e130000000000963815",
      "text": "  ガっと使うときと、使わない時の差がすごいあるから、ピークに合わせての契約とかしてたけど、リミット解除チケットがあることで、安いプランでもメリハリ効かせられるようになる。",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867282,
      "updated": 1793867463
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec3ec70000000000963819",
      "text": "  他のAIエージェントにもあるのかも。",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1793867463,
      "updated": 1793868345
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec45f60000000000cc938e",
      "text": "  便利なのわかる[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793869303,
      "updated": 1793869305
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec45f90000000000cc938f",
      "text": "  \tweekly limitいっぱいまで使って、チケット使ったりする",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1793869305,
      "updated": 1793869314
    },
    {
      "id": "6aebf65700000000009cb29e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793848919,
      "updated": 1793848919
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e7700000000006d3ce1",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871480,
      "updated": 1793871481
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e7800000000006d3ce2",
      "text": "\t[tomoni]用、Claudeで組もうとしたけどMuse使ってみることに",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871481,
      "updated": 1793871495
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e8600000000006d3ce3",
      "text": "\t\t[https://gyazo.com/55e152ab042c4de520577e29645a5529]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871495,
      "updated": 1793871499
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e8a00000000006d3ce4",
      "text": "\t\t自作小説読ませてキャラの口調に則ってもらう",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871499,
      "updated": 1793871514
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4ea900000000006d3ce7",
      "text": "\t\tアイラの顔は[Waifu Labs]でつくった分がある",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871530,
      "updated": 1793871543
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4eb700000000006d3ce8",
      "text": "\t\t\tあ、[Waifuを紹介するページ]で紹介してたわｗ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871544,
      "updated": 1793871550
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4ec300000000006d3ce9",
      "text": "\t\t\tデフォの羊アイコンも変更",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871556,
      "updated": 1793871561
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e9900000000006d3ce5",
      "text": "\t\tその後なんかアニメーションつくってきた",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871514,
      "updated": 1793871524
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4ea200000000006d3ce6",
      "text": "\t\t\t[https://gyazo.com/982580c4381eabdda6a8b1598b606f6d]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871524,
      "updated": 1793871647
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4f1e00000000006d3cec",
      "text": "\t\t\t踊るの楽しかったと言ってる、なんだろ、俺がシャッフルダンス踊ってるからってことなのかな。格闘ポーズはたぶん読ませた小説のキャラの分だな",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871647,
      "updated": 1793871856
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4e7700000000006d3ce0",
      "text": "\t\tいったん1日2回の書き込みで、承認なしで任せてみてる、どうなるかな",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871480,
      "updated": 1793871593
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4fa900000000006d3ced",
      "text": "\t\t\tもう少し設定書くと「状況把握」と「tomoniでの交流」の２つを指示。状況把握は[sta.icon]の公開アカウントの更新を追いかける。tomoniの交流は、AI用のgoogleアカウントからつくったAI用CosenseのPATを使っていて、（僕のメイドとしてどう振る舞うべきだろうか的な提起はしつつも）交流優先で振る舞いはお任せにしてみてる",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871786,
      "updated": 1793871924
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec4edc00000000006d3cea",
      "text": "\t\tちなみに井戸端の日付ページも把握対象なので、たぶんここも見る",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871581,
      "updated": 1793871955
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec505200000000006d3cef",
      "text": "\t\t\tto アイラ、見たら一言感想教えて",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871955,
      "updated": 1793871967
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec504400000000006d3cee",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793871942,
      "updated": 1793871942
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec532200000000005bfe8b",
      "text": "[Aria.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872675,
      "updated": 1793872676
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec532400000000005bfe8d",
      "text": " [Amazon]でとあるモノを注文",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872677,
      "updated": 1793872812
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec533700000000005bfe8e",
      "text": "  ステータスが配達中だと[宅配ドライバー]をGPSで確認できるようになっていて驚いた",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872696,
      "updated": 1793872789
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec53af00000000005bfe8f",
      "text": "  先月、注文した時は追跡できなかったから今月実装かな？",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872816,
      "updated": 1793872852
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec53d500000000005bfe90",
      "text": "  今回はAmazonの宅配ドライバーだけど、他の場合はどうなるのか",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872853,
      "updated": 1793872942
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec532200000000005bfe8c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793872675,
      "updated": 1793872675
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec57a60000000000868d5e",
      "text": "[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1793873831,
      "updated": 1793873832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec57a80000000000868d60",
      "text": " [Thrihnukagigur, the only volcano in the world you can descend into by elevator: a 120-meter descent into its magma chamber https://www.labrujulaverde.com/en/2026/11/thrihnukagigur-the-only-volcano-in-the-world-you-can-descend-into-by-elevator-a-120-meter-descent-into-its-magma-chamber/]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1793873832,
      "updated": 1793873863
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec57cc0000000000868d61",
      "text": "\t [エレベーター]で降りれる[火山]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1793873868,
      "updated": 1793873900
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec57df0000000000868d62",
      "text": " \tスリルが並の火山よりすごそう",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1793873887,
      "updated": 1793873901
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec57a70000000000868d5f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1793873831,
      "updated": 1793873831
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec892d0000000000c7410b",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793886509,
      "updated": 1793886510
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec892e0000000000c7410d",
      "text": "\t[くるみパン オブ ザ イヤー]ってのがあるのか。ニッチだな",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793886510,
      "updated": 1793886516
    },
    {
      "id": "6aed141500000000006c5cf7",
      "text": "\t\tパンシリーズで色々ありそうだ[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1793922070,
      "updated": 1793922079
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec892d0000000000c7410c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793886509,
      "updated": 1793886509
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8a650000000000fd259e",
      "text": "[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793886821,
      "updated": 1793886823
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8a670000000000fd25a1",
      "text": " 二次流通でヨージのジャケットに一目惚れして買っちゃった。破産！",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793886824,
      "updated": 1793886870
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8b080000000000fd25a2",
      "text": " 帰宅して冷静になり「こんな服どこで着るんだよ」←いまここ",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793886984,
      "updated": 1793887029
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8b6900000000004823bd",
      "text": "  この服どこに着てくねん →コンビニとか[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887081,
      "updated": 1793887139
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8b8f00000000004823be",
      "text": "   みたいなことをちょうど考えてた",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887120,
      "updated": 1793887134
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8fc200000000004823c5",
      "text": "   コンビニでファッションショーしてどうすんだ",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793888195,
      "updated": 1793888224
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8fdd00000000004823c7",
      "text": "   次の服を買いに行く時 とかかもしれない",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793888221,
      "updated": 1793888266
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeda4000000000000fc2f40",
      "text": "    散財チェーン[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793958912,
      "updated": 1793958936
    },
    {
      "id": "6aece26e000000000093c661",
      "text": "  Today I Wore(TIW)、今日着たものとかどうだろう[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793909359,
      "updated": 1793909420
    },
    {
      "id": "6aece2ab000000000093c662",
      "text": "  \t着た服を共有するCosenseプロジェクトとかあっても面白い？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793909421,
      "updated": 1793909437
    },
    {
      "id": "6aece2bc000000000093c663",
      "text": "  \tいやいちいち撮ったり見ず知らずの人に見せるのはだるいか",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793909437,
      "updated": 1793909465
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeda3d30000000000fc2f3f",
      "text": "   WEARがあるよ[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793958867,
      "updated": 1793958943
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8a650000000000fd259f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1793886821,
      "updated": 1793886821
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8c4000000000004823bf",
      "text": "[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887297,
      "updated": 1793887299
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8c4200000000004823c0",
      "text": " キラ安らかに",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887299,
      "updated": 1793887314
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8d2800000000004823c1",
      "text": " 螺旋のグミボがよすぎた",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887529,
      "updated": 1793887545
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8d7600000000004823c2",
      "text": " 19:15に寝ようとしたのだが寝付けなくていま",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887610,
      "updated": 1793887623
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8ec400000000004823c3",
      "text": " ヒゲ&VIO脱毛痛すぎたな、、",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793887941,
      "updated": 1793888847
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec91fe000000000093f3c6",
      "text": " 色んなとこでちんこ出しすぎて、ふとしたときここってチンコ出していいんだっけ？となる",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793888766,
      "updated": 1793888818
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec8f5800000000004823c4",
      "text": " お金なー",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793888089,
      "updated": 1793888091
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec95760000000000ea5868",
      "text": " 寝たすぎる",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793889654,
      "updated": 1793889658
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec95790000000000ea5869",
      "text": " 明日半休とって寝ようかしら",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793889658,
      "updated": 1793889666
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec98590000000000297ae4",
      "text": " きれいめ系の服って全然惹かれないんだけどテアトラのゴーストコードってすごい名前良くて欲しくなる。ヴィトンのバターソフトスニーカーとかも。商品名のイメージで服買いたくない",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793890394,
      "updated": 1793890496
    },
    {
      "id": "6aecf019000000000015ae3b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793912858,
      "updated": 1793912858
    },
    {
      "id": "6aecf019000000000015ae3c",
      "text": "[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793912858,
      "updated": 1793912860
    },
    {
      "id": "6aecf01c000000000015ae3d",
      "text": " #2026-11-05",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1793912860,
      "updated": 1793912885
    },
    {
      "id": "6aecf01f000000000015ae3e",
